# devmgr (V2 item 7c, D74): the firmware's tables from the boot data,
# ACPI's namespace, PCI over the MCFG's ECAM, the IOMMUs, and a driver host
# for each device a rule binds, given that device's MMIO, I/O ports,
# interrupt and BTI. CMake adds `resource ioport` on amd64, which alone
# has I/O ports; the system resource names the IOMMUs and allocates MSIs.
service devmgr
program devmgr
resource mmio
resource irq
resource system
@CROI_DEVMGR_IOPORT@
bootdata
programs
export
